# The trainer (#table vs Atlas), lessons and progress need no configuration.
#
# Online play (#lobby) is optional. Copy to .env.local and fill both values to
# enable sign-in; leave them empty and the lobby says online play is not set up.
# Both are browser-safe: row-level security in supabase/migrations enforces access.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
# The sb_publishable_… key (or the legacy anon key). Never a service-role key.
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
